# Scene2-2-7

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐2‐7
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:28_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『中庭』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:我来到中庭。|#0202Adv07_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是一方西洋风格的庭院，<br>看上去很适合开茶会。|#0202Adv07_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过大概是因为长期无人打理，<br>到处长满了藤蔓。|#0202Adv07_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:往上看，<br>可以看到二楼有多处用来通风的阳台。|#0202Adv07_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:庭院中央有一处喷泉。|#0202Adv07_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（要是把艾玛按进喷泉里……<br>　不行，从好几个阳台都能看见这个地方，<br>　很有可能被人看到）|#0202Adv07_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:实际上，中庭也确实有人。<br>蕾雅、诺亚和亚里沙就在稍远处。|#0202Adv07_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅和诺亚正在商量舞台剧的事。<br>而亚里沙——|#0202Adv07_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:她站在两棵紧挨着的树下面，正在摆弄着什么。<br>只见她手里拿着一根绳子。|#0202Adv07_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0202Adv07_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:150_2
@Wait WaitMode:1
@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:一幕画面闪过脑海，瞬间心跳快得几乎扑出胸膛。|#0202Adv07_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（冷静点。亚里沙并没有试图自杀）<br>|#0202Adv07_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我做了个深呼吸，<br>这时，蕾雅和诺亚看到我，向这边走来。|#0202Adv07_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Noah

[PrintTextModified Text:你好啊希罗。<br>我想让你也看看这个。|#0202Adv07_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……看什么？|#0202Adv07_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅有些兴奋地<br>把素描本递给我看。|#0202Adv07_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是舞台背景的草图。<br>是诺亚帮忙画的。|#0202Adv07_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说着，蕾雅一页页翻起素描本。|#0202Adv07_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 本のページをめくる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_43 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:每一页都画着如梦似幻的风景，<br>让我不禁看入了迷。|#0202Adv07_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:如何？画得很美吧？<br>诺亚简直是灵感之神！|#0202Adv07_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸嘿嘿，说得诺亚都不好意思了～|#0202Adv07_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……没错。每张画都很有艺术性。<br>原来你不止是喷漆画艺术家啊。|#0202Adv07_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:只要是画画，诺亚都喜欢。<br>不过最喜欢的还是喷漆画。|#0202Adv07_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我试着跟诺亚搭话，看到她笑着回应，<br>我莫名感到一点安心。|#0202Adv07_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:最近呀，<br>诺亚感觉自己操纵魔法越来越熟练了。<br>|#0202Adv07_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:魔法都能好好变成诺亚心里描绘的场景了呢。<br>一定是因为诺亚的画技提升了！|#0202Adv07_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚骄傲地挺起胸膛，<br>蕾雅也开心地连连点头赞同。|#0202Adv07_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚画出的背景，再配上我的演绎……<br>啊，我现在就开始期待站上舞台的那一刻了！|#0202Adv07_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，诺亚也很期待～|#0202Adv07_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR9,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:让我们一起创作出最精彩的舞台剧吧！|#0202Adv07_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅和诺亚相视一笑。|#0202Adv07_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……真是热情四溢啊。|#0202Adv07_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我享受舞台啊。<br>既然要做，就要做到最好。|#0202Adv07_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:作为职业演员，我决不允许半吊子的心态。<br>我想创作出好作品。<br>想创作出能打动观众心灵的好作品。|#0202Adv07_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这句话听起来像是在强烈诉说着：<br>【打动你的心灵】同样是目标的一部分。|#0202Adv07_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（蕾雅作为职业演员的态度非常端正。<br>　我不能践踏她的心情）|#0202Adv07_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我还有事要做。<br>所以没办法帮你们忙。|#0202Adv07_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但剧目上演那天，我会去看的。|#0202Adv07_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:真的吗！？|#0202Adv07_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:太好啦，蕾雅。|#0202Adv07_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，我越来越有干劲了。|#0202Adv07_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR6,ArmL3

; 劇（ピーター・パン）のセリフ

[PrintTextModified Text:“那就与我同行吧，前往那梦想诞生之地！<br>在那里，连时间都无法将我们束缚！”|#0202Adv07_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:好厉害！<br>真的像变了个人一样！|#0202Adv07_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅即兴来了一段台词，<br>让诺亚兴奋得满眼放光。|#0202Adv07_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的嘴角也不禁划出一条弧度。|#0202Adv07_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:或许我们不再像以前那般亲近，<br>但对于现在的我来说，她们依然——|#0202Adv07_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ロープが軋む首吊り音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_127 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:2

[PrintTextModified Text:——|#0202Adv07_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一阵绳子的吱呀声响传来，<br>让我的想像瞬间凝固。|#0202Adv07_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙在不远处的树下，<br>正用绳子和布料制作些什么。|#0202Adv07_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她把绳子分别缠在两棵树上。<br>然后用钩子将摊开的布挂在绳子上。|#0202Adv07_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好，差不多了。|#0202Adv07_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我离开诺亚她们，<br>朝亚里沙走去。|#0202Adv07_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你在做什么？|#0202Adv07_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:这都看不出吗。<br>我在做吊床。|#0202Adv07_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……为什么要做这个？|#0202Adv07_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:哈？|#0202Adv07_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听见我的疑问，<br>她似乎有些不解地眨了眨眼。|#0202Adv07_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:当然是用来睡觉的啊。|#0202Adv07_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:说完她就转过身，<br>像在拒绝和我继续交谈。|#0202Adv07_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她检查过强度没有问题后，<br>便躺到吊床上。|#0202Adv07_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

; ロープが軋む首吊り音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_127 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:2

; ＠備考◆痛みを堪える

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0202Adv07_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我感到一阵难以忍受的窒息感，<br>逃也似的离开了中庭。|#0202Adv07_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

